ACCESS CONTROL // acctld subsystem
===================================

acctld is the badge/zone daemon. Crew don't talk to it directly; the operator
CLI is /opt/station/modules/access_control/bin/zonectl (on PATH as `zonectl`).

  zonectl status [user]              show zone grants
  zonectl grant <user> <zone>        grant a zone
  zonectl sync --sync-as <user>      [recovery] resync a user's badge cache

`sync` was added for the company recovery effort — see recovery_notes.txt.

Data:  /opt/station/modules/access_control/data/zone_map.json
Logs:  /opt/station/modules/access_control/logs/zone_audit.log   (every invocation is recorded, incl. uid/euid)
